  "title": "Hamilton Announces Underwriting Leadership Appointments at Hamilton Global Specialty",
  "summary": "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA, March 4, 2026 — Hamilton Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: HG) (“Hamilton” or the “Company”), today announced the appointment of Sinead Cormican as Chief Underwriting Officer at Hamilton Global Specialty, its London-based underwriting platform, reporting to Alex Baker, Chief Executive Officer of Hamilton Global Specialty. Cormican will succeed Miles Osorio, who will retire at […]",
